{"id": "evt-0051", "org_id": "acme", "kind": "slack_message", "ts": "2026-09-12T09:00:00Z", "actor": "vikram", "channel": "eng-security", "thread_id": "slack:eng-security:1757664000", "text": "Every gateway pod validates JWTs with one shared HS256 secret from the config map. Simple, but rotating it means a full redeploy.", "refs": {"service_ids": ["auth-gateway"], "decision_id": "DEC-030", "ticket_id": null, "doc_id": null, "pr_id": null}, "supersedes": null, "reverses": null, "facts": [{"subject": "auth-gateway", "predicate": "SIGNS_JWT_WITH", "object": "HS256-shared-secret", "valid_at": "2026-09-12T09:00:00Z", "invalid_at": null}]}
{"id": "evt-0052", "org_id": "acme", "kind": "slack_message", "ts": "2026-09-12T09:20:00Z", "actor": "arjun", "channel": "eng-security", "thread_id": "slack:eng-security:1757664000", "text": "Fine for now, we ship PCI scope reduction first. Let's write it down as the signing decision and revisit after the audit.", "refs": {"service_ids": ["auth-gateway"], "decision_id": "DEC-030", "ticket_id": null, "doc_id": null, "pr_id": null}, "supersedes": null, "reverses": null, "facts": []}
{"id": "evt-0053", "org_id": "acme", "kind": "linear_ticket", "ts": "2026-09-14T10:00:00Z", "actor": "vikram", "channel": "linear", "thread_id": null, "text": "LIN-361: Standardize JWT signing on HS256 with a shared secret across auth-gateway pods.", "refs": {"service_ids": ["auth-gateway"], "decision_id": "DEC-030", "ticket_id": "LIN-361", "doc_id": null, "pr_id": null}, "supersedes": null, "reverses": null, "facts": [{"subject": "auth-gateway", "predicate": "TRACKED_BY", "object": "LIN-361", "valid_at": "2026-09-14T10:00:00Z", "invalid_at": null}]}
{"id": "evt-0054", "org_id": "acme", "kind": "adr", "ts": "2026-09-16T14:00:00Z", "actor": "vikram", "channel": "docs", "thread_id": null, "text": "ADR-031: JWT signing with a shared HS256 secret in auth-gateway.", "refs": {"service_ids": ["auth-gateway"], "decision_id": "DEC-030", "ticket_id": "LIN-361", "doc_id": "ADR-031", "pr_id": null}, "supersedes": null, "reverses": null, "facts": [{"subject": "auth-gateway", "predicate": "DOCUMENTED_IN", "object": "ADR-031", "valid_at": "2026-09-16T14:00:00Z", "invalid_at": null}]}
{"id": "evt-0055", "org_id": "acme", "kind": "github_pr", "ts": "2026-09-18T16:30:00Z", "actor": "vikram", "channel": "github", "thread_id": null, "text": "PR-1131: Validate gateway JWTs with the shared HS256 secret and cache verified claims for 60s.", "refs": {"service_ids": ["auth-gateway"], "decision_id": "DEC-030", "ticket_id": "LIN-361", "doc_id": "ADR-031", "pr_id": "PR-1131"}, "supersedes": null, "reverses": null, "facts": []}
{"id": "evt-0056", "org_id": "acme", "kind": "incident", "ts": "2026-10-08T02:40:00Z", "actor": "meera", "channel": "incident-ops", "thread_id": null, "text": "INC-81: The shared HS256 signing secret was printed to a debug log in an unrelated service. Any holder could mint valid tokens until rotation.", "refs": {"service_ids": ["auth-gateway"], "decision_id": null, "ticket_id": null, "doc_id": null, "pr_id": null}, "supersedes": null, "reverses": null, "facts": [{"subject": "auth-gateway", "predicate": "EXPOSED", "object": "HS256-shared-secret", "valid_at": "2026-10-08T02:40:00Z", "invalid_at": null}]}
{"id": "evt-0057", "org_id": "acme", "kind": "slack_message", "ts": "2026-10-08T03:05:00Z", "actor": "arjun", "channel": "incident-ops", "thread_id": "slack:incident-ops:1759891500", "text": "Rotating the secret needs a redeploy of every pod and would log out all users. We cannot keep a single shared secret. Moving to asymmetric keys.", "refs": {"service_ids": ["auth-gateway"], "decision_id": null, "ticket_id": null, "doc_id": null, "pr_id": null}, "supersedes": null, "reverses": null, "facts": []}
{"id": "evt-0058", "org_id": "acme", "kind": "linear_ticket", "ts": "2026-10-09T09:30:00Z", "actor": "vikram", "channel": "linear", "thread_id": null, "text": "LIN-418: Move gateway JWT signing to RS256 with per-pod keys rotated through KMS every 24 hours.", "refs": {"service_ids": ["auth-gateway"], "decision_id": "DEC-033", "ticket_id": "LIN-418", "doc_id": null, "pr_id": null}, "supersedes": "DEC-030", "reverses": null, "facts": [{"subject": "auth-gateway", "predicate": "SIGNS_JWT_WITH", "object": "RS256-KMS-rotation", "valid_at": "2026-10-09T09:30:00Z", "invalid_at": null}]}
{"id": "evt-0059", "org_id": "acme", "kind": "adr", "ts": "2026-10-11T15:00:00Z", "actor": "vikram", "channel": "docs", "thread_id": null, "text": "ADR-049: Gateway JWTs are signed with RS256 and rotated through KMS (supersedes ADR-031). Invalidates the shared HS256 secret.", "refs": {"service_ids": ["auth-gateway"], "decision_id": "DEC-033", "ticket_id": "LIN-418", "doc_id": "ADR-049", "pr_id": null}, "supersedes": "DEC-030", "reverses": null, "facts": [{"subject": "auth-gateway", "predicate": "DOCUMENTED_IN", "object": "ADR-049", "valid_at": "2026-10-11T15:00:00Z", "invalid_at": null}]}
{"id": "evt-0060", "org_id": "acme", "kind": "github_pr", "ts": "2026-10-12T17:45:00Z", "actor": "leo", "channel": "github", "thread_id": null, "text": "PR-1203: Roll out RS256 signing and KMS key rotation in auth-gateway; remove the HS256 secret from the config map.", "refs": {"service_ids": ["auth-gateway"], "decision_id": "DEC-033", "ticket_id": "LIN-418", "doc_id": "ADR-049", "pr_id": "PR-1203"}, "supersedes": "DEC-030", "reverses": null, "facts": []}
{"id": "evt-0061", "org_id": "acme", "kind": "slack_message", "ts": "2026-09-13T11:00:00Z", "actor": "david", "channel": "growth-ops", "thread_id": "slack:growth-ops:1757750400", "text": "SwiftSMS quoted us a volume discount if we route all OTP and receipt texts through them. One vendor keeps the dispatcher simple.", "refs": {"service_ids": ["notifications"], "decision_id": "DEC-028", "ticket_id": null, "doc_id": null, "pr_id": null}, "supersedes": null, "reverses": null, "facts": [{"subject": "notifications", "predicate": "SENDS_SMS_VIA", "object": "SwiftSMS", "valid_at": "2026-09-13T11:00:00Z", "invalid_at": null}]}
{"id": "evt-0062", "org_id": "acme", "kind": "slack_message", "ts": "2026-09-13T11:25:00Z", "actor": "sarah", "channel": "growth-ops", "thread_id": "slack:growth-ops:1757750400", "text": "Checkout depends on the OTP text arriving. Is there a fallback if they have a bad day?", "refs": {"service_ids": ["notifications"], "decision_id": "DEC-028", "ticket_id": null, "doc_id": null, "pr_id": null}, "supersedes": null, "reverses": null, "facts": []}
{"id": "evt-0063", "org_id": "acme", "kind": "slack_message", "ts": "2026-09-13T11:40:00Z", "actor": "david", "channel": "growth-ops", "thread_id": "slack:growth-ops:1757750400", "text": "Their SLA is 99.95 percent. We accept the single-provider risk for the discount.", "refs": {"service_ids": ["notifications"], "decision_id": "DEC-028", "ticket_id": null, "doc_id": null, "pr_id": null}, "supersedes": null, "reverses": null, "facts": []}
{"id": "evt-0064", "org_id": "acme", "kind": "linear_ticket", "ts": "2026-09-15T13:00:00Z", "actor": "david", "channel": "linear", "thread_id": null, "text": "LIN-366: Route all notification-dispatcher SMS traffic through SwiftSMS.", "refs": {"service_ids": ["notifications"], "decision_id": "DEC-028", "ticket_id": "LIN-366", "doc_id": null, "pr_id": null}, "supersedes": null, "reverses": null, "facts": []}
{"id": "evt-0065", "org_id": "acme", "kind": "adr", "ts": "2026-09-19T10:00:00Z", "actor": "david", "channel": "docs", "thread_id": null, "text": "ADR-033: Single SMS provider (SwiftSMS) for the notification dispatcher.", "refs": {"service_ids": ["notifications"], "decision_id": "DEC-028", "ticket_id": "LIN-366", "doc_id": "ADR-033", "pr_id": null}, "supersedes": null, "reverses": null, "facts": [{"subject": "notifications", "predicate": "DOCUMENTED_IN", "object": "ADR-033", "valid_at": "2026-09-19T10:00:00Z", "invalid_at": null}]}
{"id": "evt-0066", "org_id": "acme", "kind": "incident", "ts": "2026-10-05T14:10:00Z", "actor": "sarah", "channel": "incident-ops", "thread_id": null, "text": "INC-79: SwiftSMS had a regional outage for two hours. 41 percent of checkout OTP texts failed and conversion dropped.", "refs": {"service_ids": ["notifications", "web-checkout"], "decision_id": null, "ticket_id": null, "doc_id": null, "pr_id": null}, "supersedes": null, "reverses": null, "facts": [{"subject": "notifications", "predicate": "FAILED_DUE_TO", "object": "SwiftSMS-outage", "valid_at": "2026-10-05T14:10:00Z", "invalid_at": null}]}
{"id": "evt-0067", "org_id": "acme", "kind": "slack_message", "ts": "2026-10-06T09:15:00Z", "actor": "david", "channel": "growth-ops", "thread_id": "slack:growth-ops:1759742100", "text": "We should never have run on one carrier. Adding BeamSMS as an automatic fallback behind SwiftSMS.", "refs": {"service_ids": ["notifications"], "decision_id": null, "ticket_id": null, "doc_id": null, "pr_id": null}, "supersedes": null, "reverses": null, "facts": []}
{"id": "evt-0068", "org_id": "acme", "kind": "linear_ticket", "ts": "2026-10-07T10:30:00Z", "actor": "david", "channel": "linear", "thread_id": null, "text": "LIN-415: Send SMS through SwiftSMS first with automatic failover to BeamSMS after two consecutive errors.", "refs": {"service_ids": ["notifications"], "decision_id": "DEC-032", "ticket_id": "LIN-415", "doc_id": null, "pr_id": null}, "supersedes": "DEC-028", "reverses": null, "facts": [{"subject": "notifications", "predicate": "SENDS_SMS_VIA", "object": "SwiftSMS-with-BeamSMS-failover", "valid_at": "2026-10-07T10:30:00Z", "invalid_at": null}]}
{"id": "evt-0069", "org_id": "acme", "kind": "adr", "ts": "2026-10-09T16:00:00Z", "actor": "david", "channel": "docs", "thread_id": null, "text": "ADR-048: SMS uses SwiftSMS with automatic BeamSMS failover (supersedes ADR-033). Invalidates the single-provider setup.", "refs": {"service_ids": ["notifications"], "decision_id": "DEC-032", "ticket_id": "LIN-415", "doc_id": "ADR-048", "pr_id": null}, "supersedes": "DEC-028", "reverses": null, "facts": [{"subject": "notifications", "predicate": "DOCUMENTED_IN", "object": "ADR-048", "valid_at": "2026-10-09T16:00:00Z", "invalid_at": null}]}
